  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 05 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 4A 03}去吃肉！！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_142.bf.json:41:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_039",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0D 01 0D 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 60 09}就点瘦牛肉盖饭。\n生蛋清、蛋白粉，统统加量！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e915_142.bf.json:42:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_040",
